WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:04.102
Cora swam back to Rock Canyon.

2
00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:07.622
Octo and Andy followed.

3
00:00:07.623 --> 00:00:19.861
"Help!" the young angelfish cried.

4
00:00:19.862 --> 00:00:24.410
"I'll get you out," Cora said.

5
00:00:24.411 --> 00:00:28.776
"And I'm going to help!" Octo said.

6
00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:32.247
The cousins grabbed onto the rock.

7
00:00:32.248 --> 00:00:39.064
"One, two, three! " Cora said.

8
00:00:39.065 --> 00:00:41.930
"Now!" Cora and Octo pulled

9
00:00:41.931 --> 00:00:46.304
together. They pulled with all their

10
00:00:46.305 --> 00:00:50.281
might. The rock

11
00:00:50.282 --> 00:00:56.926
moved! The young angelfish were

12
00:00:56.927 --> 00:00:59.100
free! They swam to

13
00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:05.853
Andy. "You're safe!" he

14
00:01:05.854 --> 00:01:09.351
cried. "Hooray for Cora!" Mo

15
00:01:09.352 --> 00:01:12.845
said. He grinned and flipped upside

16
00:01:12.846 --> 00:01:16.083
