18
00:01:19.381 --> 00:01:23.483
"I had a great helper—Octo!" Cora said.

19
00:01:23.484 --> 00:01:26.430
She pointed to her cousin.

20
00:01:26.431 --> 00:01:31.287
"Octo, our hero!" the angelfish said.

21
00:01:31.288 --> 00:01:40.429
Octo happily waved his tentacles.

22
00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:43.921
Later it was time for Octo to leave.

23
00:01:43.922 --> 00:01:51.254
Octo sighed. "I wish I could stay longer.

24
00:01:51.255 --> 00:01:54.226
Bye, Cora and Mo!" he said.

25
00:01:54.227 --> 00:01:59.444
"Bye, Octo!" they called.

26
00:01:59.445 --> 00:02:07.485
They swam back to Cora's den.

27
00:02:07.486 --> 00:02:11.919
"Ah, peace and quiet," Cora said.

28
00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:15.592
"I think you miss the noise," Mo said.

29
00:02:15.593 --> 00:02:20.939
Cora grinned. "Maybe just a little."

